{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-00113", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "smishing", "pred": "smishing", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The SMS exhibits several strong indicators of smishing. The message uses an urgent, sales-like tone (\"available now\") to entice the recipient. Crucially, it contains a suspicious, non-standard URL (`whatseehere2.info/fDoWou`) which is characteristic of phishing attempts designed to trick users into clicking and potentially entering personal or financial information. Furthermore, the offer itself—a housing listing with \"no credit check required\"—is often used in scams to lure victims.\n\nFINAL: smishing"}
