{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-00356", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "smishing", "pred": "smishing", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The message exhibits several strong indicators of smishing. The content is highly suggestive and unsolicited, which is a common tactic in spam and phishing attempts. The inclusion of a shortened, suspicious link (`tinyurl.com/Kelseygame52`) is a major red flag, as these links are often used to direct users to malicious websites designed to steal information or install malware. The message itself is designed to entice the recipient with explicit content, a classic lure used in phishing scams.\n\nFINAL: smishing"}
