{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-01159", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "ham", "pred": "ham", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The SMS message is classified as ham. The message is a very casual, informal text exchange (\"Ok lor wat time ü finish?\"), using colloquial language and abbreviations. It does not contain any suspicious elements such as urgency, suspicious links, brand impersonation, or requests for personal information or payment. It appears to be a normal, personal conversation between acquaintances.\n\nFINAL: ham"}
