{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-01908", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "ham", "pred": "ham", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The SMS message \"I will once i get home\" is a very short, informal, and conversational message. It lacks any of the typical hallmarks of smishing, such as:\n*   **Urgency:** There is no sense of immediate threat or need to act quickly.\n*   **Suspicious Links:** No URLs are present.\n*   **Brand Impersonation:** No recognizable brand is being spoofed.\n*   **Requests for Personal Info/Payment:** It does not ask for any sensitive data or money.\n\nThe message appears to be a simple update or confirmation between two parties who likely have an existing relationship, making it benign.\n\nFINAL: ham"}
