{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-01997", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "ham", "pred": "ham", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The SMS message is classified as ham. The message is a casual, conversational request (\"Or better still can you catch her and let ask her if she can sell <> for me.\"). It lacks any of the typical hallmarks of smishing, such as urgency, suspicious links, brand impersonation, or requests for sensitive personal information or payment. It appears to be a personal communication between acquaintances.\n\nFINAL: ham"}
