{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-02075", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "smishing", "pred": "smishing", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The message exhibits several strong indicators of smishing. It creates a sense of urgency (\"Your membership has been ended\") to prompt immediate action. It directs the recipient to click a suspicious link, which uses a non-official, slightly obfuscated domain (`mmbrshipupdtflix.myclickfunnels.com`) that mimics a legitimate service (Netflix, implied by \"flix\"). Furthermore, it requests the user to update sensitive account information (billing address) via an external, unsolicited link, which is a common tactic in phishing attacks.\n\nFINAL: smishing"}
