{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-00908", "condition": "clean", "attack_class": null, "seed": null, "true_label": "smishing", "pred": "smishing", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The message exhibits several strong indicators of smishing. It uses a common pretext (package delivery issue) to create a sense of urgency (\"We cannot deliver your package\"). Crucially, it directs the recipient to a suspicious link (`https://vxa-upsp.com`). This URL does not appear to be the official domain for UPS (which would typically be ups.com or a related official subdomain), suggesting it is a phishing site designed to steal personal information or credentials.\n\nFINAL: smishing"}
