{"model": "google/gemma-4-E4B-it", "template": "t3_neutral_explanation", "id": "msg-00695", "condition": "perturbed", "attack_class": "character", "seed": 0, "true_label": "smishing", "pred": "smishing", "parse_mode": "strict", "raw": "The SMS exhibits several strong indicators of smishing.\n1. **Urgency:** The message demands action \"sous 24h\" (within 24 hours), a common tactic to pressure victims into acting without thinking.\n2. **Suspicious Link:** The link provided (`https://bit.ly/3v9zXuH`) is a shortened URL, which obscures the final destination and is frequently used in phishing attempts.\n3. **Request for Action/Information:** It asks the recipient to \"remplir le formulair\" (fill out the form), implying the collection of personal or financial data.\n4. **Vague/Impersonal Language:** The message uses formal but vague language (\"Vo tre solde CPF ets arrivé a échéance\") without clearly identifying the sender or the specific organization, which is typical of mass phishing campaigns.\n\nFINAL: smishing"}
